{
  "info": {
    "name": "HF Medusa — Suggestive Selling + VoucherEngine (Complete API)",
    "description": "Complete REST API collection for Suggestive Selling (Day 3–4 · Sơn) and VoucherEngine (Day 1–4 · Thức, Hùng).\n\n**Store APIs (Customer-Facing):**\n- GET /store/products/:id/suggestions — product-level recommendations\n- GET /store/carts/:id/suggestions — cart-level CR-01..CR-04 recommendations\n- POST /store/carts/:id/suggested-items — add suggested item to cart\n- POST /store/carts/:id/voucher — apply voucher\n- DELETE /store/carts/:id/voucher — remove voucher\n- GET /store/customers/me/vouchers — fetch customer's applied/redeemed vouchers\n- POST /store/suggestion-events — log analytics events (view/add/filter)\n\n**Admin APIs (Management):**\n- Suggestion Rules (CRUD) — manage cart rules (CR-01..04 config)\n- Category Complement Mappings (CRUD) — CR-01 category pairs\n- Product Bulk Mappings (CRUD) — CR-04 single↔bulk product pairs\n- Category Top Sellers (read) — Tier-2 ranking snapshot for sales-desc order\n- Suggestion Events (read) — aggregated analytics\n- Vouchers (create, analytics) — create/manage voucher configs\n\n**Auth & Headers:**\n- Store: x-publishable-api-key (from seed, default provided); optional bearer token for customer context\n- Admin: bearer token (JWT from login); x-publishable-api-key for store-facing admin dashboards\n- Session: x-session-id (optional, scopes dismissal + analytics per session)\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Run Setup › Login to get admin token\n2. Run Setup › Get Publishable Key\n3. Run Setup › Create Cart + Add Items\n4. Then run Store › Suggestions / Vouchers workflows\n\n**Note:** All endpoints follow the degrade contract (BR-10) — failures return HTTP 200 with empty results, not 5xx. Tests assert shape, not non-emptiness.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:9009",
      "description": "backend port (.env PORT=9009)"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "postman@test.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "Supersecret123"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "description": "admin JWT — auto-filled by Setup › Login"
    },
    {
      "key": "publishableKey",
      "value": "pk_160f5ac26e56619f4b1913353ebac7932a8c390e6a6379879df59db4a8b34de7",
      "description": "x-publishable-api-key (Default from seed). Re-fetch via Setup › Get publishable key if rotates."
    },
    {
      "key": "sessionId",
      "value": "sess_postman_demo",
      "description": "x-session-id — scopes dismissal set + analytics (D6/SEC-04)"
    },
    {
      "key": "regionId",
      "value": "reg_01KX54P002XZTC793GRS1QMW53",
      "description": "Vietnam / VND (from seed)"
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "prod_01KX5SXC11R4JQY12RFMQ5KDW2",
      "description": "apacs-astrox-77 (source for product suggestions)"
    },
    {
      "key": "cartId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "created by Setup › Create Cart"
    },
    {
      "key": "voucherCode",
      "value": "SUMMER50",
      "description": "voucher code to test"
    },
    {
      "key": "voucherId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "voucher UUID (from list or create)"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "  pm.test('Token extracted', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.exist);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/user/emailpass",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "user",
                "emailpass"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Publishable Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/publishable-api-keys",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "publishable-api-keys"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Cart",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.cart && json.cart.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('cartId', json.cart.id);",
                  "  pm.test('Cart created', () => pm.expect(json.cart.id).to.exist);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-publishable-api-key",
                "value": "{{publishableKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"region_id\": \"{{regionId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/store/carts",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "store",
                "carts"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Item to Cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-publishable-api-key",
                "value": "{{publishableKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variant_id\": \"variant_01KX5SXCZAYBXJZTKGQ64RJE4C\",\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/store/carts/{{cartId}}/line-items",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "store",
                "carts",
                "{{cartId}}",
                "line-items"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Store — Suggestive Selling",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Product-Level Suggestions",
